{"topic_name": "Puzzle", "id": "377978390272490"}], "release_date": 1776264360, "lastRevision": {"nodes": [{"id": "26487178037580577", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "administration_status": "APPROVED", "pdp_metadata": {"application": {"default_locale": "en_US", "id": "26487177984247249", "is_first_party": false, "enables_in_app_ads": false, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF"}, "iarc_cert": {"id": "1568259901589334"}, "iarc_email": null, "msrp": null, "translations": {"nodes": [{"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "965357809361260", "locale": "de_DE", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Bams Solitaire VR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Willkommen an Ihrem pers\u00f6nlichen virtuellen Strand. Entfliehen Sie dem Alltag mit Bams Solitaire VR!\n\nBams Solitaire VR verwandelt das klassische Kartenspiel in einen entspannenden Kurzurlaub. Stellen Sie sich vor: Sie sitzen an einer ruhigen Bucht, \u00fcber Ihnen leuchtet der Sternenhimmel, sanftes Meeresrauschen umgibt Sie, und aus einem kleinen Strandradio klingt entspannte Musik. Vor Ihnen schwebt Ihr Solit\u00e4r-Spiel direkt \u00fcber den sanften Wellen.\n\n**Maritimes Design trifft auf magische Atmosph\u00e4re**\nJedes Detail wurde mit Liebe zum Meer gestaltet. Entdecken Sie unsere einzigartigen, Bildkarten \u2013 von der majest\u00e4tischen Meeresk\u00f6nigin bis hin zu Poseidon selbst.\n\n**Greifbare VR-Physik statt flacher Klicks**\nDank unserer nativen, hochperformanten Engine sp\u00fcren Sie jede Bewegung:\n* Perfektes Greifen: Greifen Sie Karten oder ganze Stapel intuitiv mit Ihren H\u00e4nden oder Controllern. Haptisches Feedback l\u00e4sst Sie das Gewicht der Karten f\u00f6rmlich sp\u00fcren.\n* Der \"Ninja Flick\": Verbringen Sie keine Zeit mit langweiligem Ablegen. Werfen Sie die Karten mit einem leichten Schwung aus dem Handgelenk quer \u00fcber den Tisch in ihre Ziel-Slots! \n* Volle Kontrolle: Ziehen Sie das gesamte Spielfeld mit den schwebenden Steuergriffen genau in die Position, die f\u00fcr Sie am bequemsten ist.\n\n**Vier Klassiker an einem Strand**\nSpielen Sie Ihre absoluten Lieblingsmodi, perfekt angepasst f\u00fcr die Virtual Reality:\n* Klondike\n* Spider\n* FreeCell\n* Pyramide", "short_description": "Entspannendes Strand-Solit\u00e4r in VR. Lausche dem sanften Meeresrauschen, greife die Karten mit deinen eigenen H\u00e4nden und genie\u00dfe die Magie."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BSVR1440x1440.png", "id": "2265746220908120", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820496_2265746224241453_8663149544726326029_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LaSXCv91i3UQ7kNvwFXvFmv&_nc_oc=AdrZaziH7MX5AGKt26K7DujYA8jK_q9UL7TTrCX8lTtIMTNsg8Of5bGZbrPqBRGrd4Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9UAwYxFZfBdqa_OVYwULwz2taCrTUbaBT7Ewhh-LzB1w&oe=6A33EB03"}, {"file_name": "bams_icon.png", "id": "1853345692009190", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821674_1853345695342523_4969261726722226581_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=17eVFq84OSgQ7kNvwGmvDg5&_nc_oc=Adqpoe6yA_zxdNeYBNENqhYmNfOHncTK661xjqhI8B5fWkCWkZAvmLxj4k0AJ3wmvDo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8UoyD1ces8dC3L3A4zpj_gmY9N7LhsEFTNzoKV6hzTlA&oe=6A33F820"}, {"file_name": "BSVR1008x1440.png", "id": "1280206627403407", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823812_1280206630736740_1767039078555120883_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=senkDxMZNdAQ7kNvwHZcnjg&_nc_oc=Adp6LUOG6c7rojYMEXzuhpTWGFArxA2hKKE5zoiUf8DhwE3RU1xpqVBu4sJjrAsfUF8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8PkN3T1RRCoMZ1Y-34ERpsyCovxi6hodNXcmCBE8VOTg&oe=6A3406D8"}, {"file_name": "BSVR2560x1440.png", "id": "1240424004917207", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822327_1240424008250540_5120684943954837147_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xQxnODbkpPMQ7kNvwEK1Cr6&_nc_oc=Ado9qacS_2WIvM27SYJLKwPe5kPSrxYOqRw0ghaDM7x-3l4Y-ZVHxh3uNCLOmh7gzFA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9AetM6vgPaWMQxcLhM4mhQB945m6PnaYJpcmmBTD1nNA&oe=6A340A16"}, {"file_name": "Hero Art BSVR.png", "id": "933944619503893", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823802_933944626170559_4723201925290549549_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=S-3L2A4FusIQ7kNvwHsG3uM&_nc_oc=AdoOA49XhPHFz5HnOJzSXGzPzS7tVjjP9h5MSwfveoxGNle2SazEvQGqiaj7kLZR1RA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_UZ7MeyiAzAItAvIZ6OIpjhcwKsh4irV0kvGc0OktK7g&oe=6A33F970"}, {"file_name": "bams_logo_meta.png", "id": "793646677155197", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821782_793646680488530_2105530370413873091_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XP_Tfu9K0xIQ7kNvwGO5HxB&_nc_oc=AdrZKI7IIT8v4773yHc7KGz10tNkDAvhZla8NO24FKoUbNcmD9v2yMQf7ujeXZcnsdM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8buR-CvnL0lGqeTuU913J47cFnHkf79IcC9Xh82n_8zg&oe=6A341729"}]}, "id": "838816315903314", "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "ScreenshotBSVR2.png", "id": "1298204515582726", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821568_1298204518916059_8869792458384025742_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Hp8u7ypY8qYQ7kNvwEwmcvp&_nc_oc=AdooPfu8B1FxIQmL-6XCwVfrC-qj50gAyRwgMGb-slBtWQTk-AY778_i5rjnTsLwK80&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_umaauysaGTN13ULND5hHeaT4Tn7DO0LXhizn3yRZ71A&oe=6A33EB96"}, {"file_name": "ScreenshotBSVR4.png", "id": "2985541324983450", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820855_2985541328316783_6181994284030423808_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_fchBSGnITQQ7kNvwHsIECw&_nc_oc=AdoTGg-C2UPI0ytUbKQTWZ9N54UwZIrcXzjKoNUdvbdyjQOlvZUC9zVjpNNvj2uStT8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af98lX4quc21nZdwZiAU71PDNdv2o5g4jtr-0E3z_rHqMA&oe=6A33F5FE"}, {"file_name": "ScreenshotBSVR5.png", "id": "26075450892156956", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821696_26075450915490287_155639571789113632_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iIztwTvRXlEQ7kNvwGgAvLL&_nc_oc=AdoGsC-E1pY2M5eeO1xxCAToHs2ydrRokE2LljgqHFQqHk2wB8DL4qY1WD7ixNScq7s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_MycC_LwzhB-fzVR9Sb7aiRvpfoCYgjgOAwob7CdC8lw&oe=6A3403CF"}, {"file_name": "ScreenshotBSVR1.png", "id": "1647149749963491", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820923_1647149753296824_4887864137137797585_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=K5ON0FIezH4Q7kNvwEpPZuo&_nc_oc=AdqFmYVynVK-srL8rPEzh-ceK-qvlyJVIkPSIYWxDw3QSmEzVse9NZBlWE3jf17p0xc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_jjSfSAdYdOIGmg8et2FNjsWorhuIWDh9lhSBBj7WrhA&oe=6A33FCE1"}, {"file_name": "ScreenshotBSVR3.png", "id": "1582692552837284", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828104_1582692556170617_5582135335785372982_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=efz7cqTRzeQQ7kNvwE3ArVo&_nc_oc=AdrV_tC5FpLR3AAL4ZRcmloD-kIOD3Mxa5SUb_OaGzy0X5EroqwdEtSfok1R9t6PGhg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af86LqwUHncxE9FS4E_hdzGfh1wlN_CqSOBKbAhKgZjVQQ&oe=6A3401B0"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Bams Solitaire VR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Welcome to your personal virtual beach. Escape the daily grind with Bams Solitaire VR!\n\nBams Solitaire VR transforms the classic card game into a relaxing getaway. Imagine sitting by a quiet bay, the starry sky shining above you, surrounded by the gentle sound of the ocean, while relaxing music plays from a small beach radio. Right in front of you, your solitaire game floats above the gentle waves.\n\n**Maritime Design Meets Magical Atmosphere**\nEvery detail has been crafted with a love for the sea. Discover our unique, hand-drawn face cards \u2013 from the majestic Sea Queen to Poseidon himself. Play with maritime card backs and let the environment enchant you as a message in a bottle drifts in the water.\n\n**Tangible VR Physics instead of Flat Clicks**\nThanks to our native, highly performant engine, you feel every movement:\n* Perfect Grabbing: Intuitively grab cards or entire stacks with your hands or controllers. Haptic feedback lets you literally feel the weight of the cards.\n* The \"Ninja Flick\": Throw the cards across the table into their target slots with a flick of your wrist!\n* Full Control: Drag the entire playing field into the exact position that is most comfortable for you using the floating control handles.\n\n**Four Classics on One Beach**\nPlay your absolute favorite modes, perfectly adapted for Virtual Reality:\n* Klondike\n* Spider\n* FreeCell\n* Pyramid\n\n**Exclusive VR Features:**\n* Interactive Environment: Turn on the beach radio, read mysterious messages from the bottle,", "short_description": "Relaxing beach solitaire in VR. Listen to the gentle sound of the ocean, grab the cards with your own hands, and enjoy the magic."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://bams-design.ch/game/datenschutz.txt", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Bams Design", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://bams-design.ch/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "377978390272490"}, {"id": "1676485315806614"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, 